BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Killed by AI//Upcoming AI shutdowns//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Upcoming AI shutdowns — Killed by AI
X-WR-CALDESC:Confirmed shutdown and deprecation dates for AI products and models. Source: killedbyai.net/coming-soon/
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1D
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mai-code-1-flash-github-copilot@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260910
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260911
SUMMARY:🪦 MAI-Code-1-Flash (GitHub Copilot) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Announced August 21\, gone from Copilot September 10 — twenty days' notice for a model that was itself the named replacement for Raptor mini. The only Copilot retirement on the calendar after September 8. Replacement: MAI-Code-1.1-Flash. Source: https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/ai-models/supported-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#mai-code-1-flash-github-copilot
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amazon-nova-gen-1-premier-sonic-canvas-reel@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260914
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260915
SUMMARY:🪦 Amazon Nova Gen-1 (Premier\, Sonic\, Canvas\, Reel) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Amazon's first-generation Nova line is being cleared off Bedrock: Premier and Sonic on September 14\, Canvas and Reel on September 30. Nova launched at re:Invent in December 2024 as Amazon's answer to frontier models\; the second generation replaces it inside two years. Replacement: Nova 2 Sonic / Nova 2 Lite\; Luma Ray v2 for video. Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/model-lifecycle.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#amazon-nova-gen-1-premier-sonic-canvas-reel
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mai-transcribe-1-microsoft-foundry@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260915
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260916
SUMMARY:🪦 MAI-Transcribe-1 (Microsoft Foundry) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Version 2026-01-23\, retired September 15\, 2026 — less than eight months old. Microsoft's first-party speech model line is now on the same accelerated churn as its image models. Replacement: MAI-Transcribe-1.5. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#mai-transcribe-1-microsoft-foundry
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sora-api@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260924
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260925
SUMMARY:🪦 Sora API shuts down
DESCRIPTION:While the Sora app died in April\, the API endpoint survives until September. Then it's gone completely. Replacement: None (ChatGPT image gen only). Source: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001152-what-to-know-about-the-sora-discontinuation
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#sora-api
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-davinci-002-babbage-002-gpt-3-5-turbo-instruct@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260928
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260929
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI davinci-002\, babbage-002 & gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The end of the GPT-3 base-model lineage. These three shipped in August 2023\, inherited the job when the original ada/babbage/curie/davinci died in January 2024\, and are the last models served over the legacy /v1/completions endpoint. Their own fine-tuned versions outlive them by 25 days. Replacement: gpt-5.6-terra. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-davinci-002-babbage-002-gpt-3-5-turbo-instruct
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mistral-leanstral-1-5@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:🪦 Mistral Leanstral 1.5 shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Mistral announced this Lean 4 formal-proof model's death in the same sentence that announced its birth. The changelog reads: 'We released Leanstral 1.5... This model will be retired on September 30\, 2026.' A 92-day advertised lifespan\, dead on arrival by design. Replacement: None named. Source: https://github.com/mistralai/platform-docs-public
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#mistral-leanstral-1-5
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amazon-mechanical-turk@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:🪦 Amazon Mechanical Turk shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The 21-year-old marketplace Jeff Bezos once called "artificial artificial intelligence" — the humans who labelled a generation of training data — closes on September 30\, 2026. New customers were cut off July 30. Amazon cites "an internal assessment of its programs and services"\; everyone else notes that the models MTurk workers trained now do MTurk's job. Replacement: None — Scale AI\, Mercor and Prolific absorbed the market. Source: https://www.cnbc.com/2026/08/25/amazon-service-that-jeff-bezos-called-artificial-ai-is-shutting-down.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#amazon-mechanical-turk
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-omni-flash-preview@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:🪦 Gemini Omni Flash Preview shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google's text-and-image-to-video model shipped June 30\, 2026 and was deprecated on August 27\, the day gemini-omni-1.1-flash went GA. Shutdown September 30 — a 92-day life\, with the successor announced and the death date set in the same changelog entry. Replacement: gemini-omni-1.1-flash. Source: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/changelog
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-omni-flash-preview
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:google-gemini-2-5-flash-image-nano-banana@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
SUMMARY:🪦 Google Gemini 2.5 Flash Image ("Nano Banana") shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The image model that went viral as 'Nano Banana' and briefly made Gemini the #1 free iPhone app shuts down exactly one year after release\, to the day. Google's officially recommended replacement\, gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview\, was itself shut down in June 2026. The migration target is dead\; the model isn't yet. Replacement: gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview (already retired). Source: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#google-gemini-2-5-flash-image-nano-banana
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-gpt-4-1-4-1-mini-4-1-nano@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:🪦 Azure OpenAI GPT-4.1\, 4.1 mini & 4.1 nano shuts down
DESCRIPTION:GPT-4.1 launched April 2025 as OpenAI's 'best model for coding' with a 1M-token context window. Azure retires it\, plus mini and nano\, after 18 months. Fine-tuned deployments on the same bases get a one-year stay of execution. Replacement: gpt-5 / gpt-5-mini / gpt-5-nano. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-foundry/openai/concepts/model-retirements
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-gpt-4-1-4-1-mini-4-1-nano
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sora-2-on-azure-openai-foundry@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261016
SUMMARY:🪦 Sora 2 on Azure OpenAI / Foundry shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Sora outlives its maker's own shutdown by three weeks: Microsoft pushed the Azure retirement from September 15 to October 15\, with no replacement. OpenAI's own Sora API dies September 24. The last place to generate a Sora video will be a Microsoft data centre. Replacement: None listed. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#sora-2-on-azure-openai-foundry
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-2-5-pro-flash-flash-lite-vertex-ai@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261016
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261017
SUMMARY:🪦 Gemini 2.5 Pro / Flash / Flash Lite (Vertex AI) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google's entire Gemini 2.5 family retires on Vertex AI no earlier than October 16\, 2026. Note this is Vertex-only — the Gemini Developer API still lists no shutdown date for the same three models. Replacement: Gemini 3.x series. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-2-5-pro-flash-flash-lite-vertex-ai
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-o-series-o1-o3-o4-mini-o3-pro@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:🪦 Azure OpenAI o-series (o1\, o3\, o4-mini\, o3-pro) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Azure deletes an entire generation of reasoning models in under 90 days: o3-mini October 1\, o4-mini October 16\, o1/o1-pro/o3 October 21\, codex-mini November 15\, o3-pro December 17. Four have no named replacement — Microsoft declares one only 90 to 120 days out\, because 'declaring a replacement too early risks directing customers to a model that is no longer the best available option.' Replacement: gpt-5.6-sol (partial)\; several unnamed. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-o-series-o1-o3-o4-mini-o3-pro
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-open-model-maas-13-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:🪦 Vertex AI Open-Model MaaS (13 models) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google Cloud drops managed serving for 13 open models on October 21 — DeepSeek V3.1\, GLM-5 and 4.7\, gpt-oss-20b\, Kimi K2 Thinking\, Llama 3.3 70B\, MiniMax M2\, two e5 embedding models and four Qwen3 variants. You can still run them\; you just have to host them yourself. Replacement: Self-deploy the weights from Model Garden. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/deprecations/open-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-open-model-maas-13-models
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-fine-tuning-new-orgs@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Fine-tuning (new orgs) shuts down
DESCRIPTION:New organizations can no longer create fine-tuning jobs. The first wave executed on schedule July 23\, 2026\; the second takes every remaining fine-tuned model — ft-gpt-3.5-turbo\, ft-gpt-4\, ft-gpt-4.1-nano\, ft-babbage-002 and ft-davinci-002 — on October 23. Replacement: Prompt caching / system prompts. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-fine-tuning-new-orgs
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-4-gpt-4-turbo-gpt-3-5-turbo-the-o-series@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI GPT-4\, GPT-4 Turbo\, GPT-3.5 Turbo & the o-series shuts down
DESCRIPTION:One date kills three eras. On October 23\, OpenAI removes gpt-3.5-turbo (the engine that launched ChatGPT)\, gpt-4 and gpt-4-0613 (the model that defined 2023)\, and its entire first generation of reasoning models — o1\, o1-pro\, o3-mini\, o4-mini — plus gpt-4o-2024-05-13 and gpt-image-1. Every fine-tune built on them dies the same day. Seventeen table rows\, six months' notice. Replacement: gpt-5.5 / gpt-5.4-mini / gpt-5.4-nano / gpt-image-2. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-4-gpt-4-turbo-gpt-3-5-turbo-the-o-series
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-extensions@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:🪦 Vertex AI Extensions shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Google's managed tool-calling framework for Gemini\, deprecated with the standard six-month window and switched off after November 26\, 2026. The replacement is the Agent Platform — the third name for this idea in as many years. Replacement: Agent Platform. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-extensions
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-legacy-gpt-image-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Legacy GPT Image Models shuts down
DESCRIPTION:Older GPT Image model snapshots were flagged for removal from the API on December 1\, 2026\, just months after they replaced DALL·E. The endpoint that buried DALL·E is already on its own deprecation clock. Replacement: GPT Image 1.5. Source: https://platform.openai.com/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-legacy-gpt-image-models
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-5-original-snapshots-o3-o3-pro@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI GPT-5 (original snapshots)\, o3 & o3-pro shuts down
DESCRIPTION:The original GPT-5 launch snapshots — gpt-5-2025-08-07 and its mini\, nano and pro siblings — plus o3 and o3-pro shut down December 11. GPT-5 launched in August 2025 as the 'PhD-level expert' model. Its launch snapshot gets 16 months before it starts returning errors. Replacement: gpt-5.6-sol / gpt-5.6-terra / gpt-5.6-luna. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-5-original-snapshots-o3-o3-pro
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-realtime-audio-model-family@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270121
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Realtime & Audio Model Family shuts down
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI put its entire GA voice stack on death row: gpt-realtime\, gpt-audio\, gpt-realtime-mini\, gpt-audio-mini and all four gpt-4o audio/realtime variants. gpt-realtime and gpt-audio went GA in August 2025 — the models that headlined 'production-ready voice agents' get roughly 17 months. OpenAI is skipping its own intermediate generation: the 1.5 series shipped in February 2026 and the named replacement is already 2.1. Replacement: gpt-realtime-2.1 / gpt-realtime-2.1-mini / gpt-audio-1.5. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-realtime-audio-model-family
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-whisper-1-gpt-4o-transcribe@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20260909T054710Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270226
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270227
SUMMARY:🪦 OpenAI Whisper-1 & GPT-4o Transcribe shuts down
DESCRIPTION:On August 26 OpenAI deprecated whisper-1 — its original speech-to-text API from March 2023 — together with gpt-4o-transcribe\, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize\, the last of which shipped in October 2025. All four die February 26\, 2027. The open-source Whisper weights are unaffected\; the hosted endpoint that made them a product is not. Replacement: gpt-transcribe / gpt-live-transcribe. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations#2026-08-26-transcription-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-whisper-1-gpt-4o-transcribe
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
